# Design system: Pulita

This project’s canonical visual system is **Pulita** (white / wash, organic Cubot-blue atmosphere, Instrument Serif display, Geist body, navy pill CTAs). Before any UI change, read and follow:

- `.cursor/skills/pattern-full-bleed-grid/SKILL.md`
- `.cursor/skills/pattern-full-bleed-grid/PATTERN.md` (source of truth)
- Implementation: `src/looks/clean.css` on `html[data-look="clean"]`

Non-negotiable: 1200px content column, one primary CTA per section, no 6-column overlay. Display is **Instrument Serif** italic; body is Geist; meta is uppercase tracking. Page is white `#ffffff` with wash `#f5f8fb` on Chi sono / Servizi / Contatti. CTA is navy `#1e3a8a` on white, radius `999px`. Sky `#38bdf8` is atmosphere only — never body text on white. Card radius `16px`–`24px` with `--soft-shadow`. Do not restore Inchiostro lastre (ink `#121212` plates, radius `0`, sky CTAs on dark). Never mix neon `#00df8f`, Inter, Space Grotesk, or process yellow `#f0c400`.
